Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:15:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Wire development node transaction pool relay and bounded pool
 mining

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Connect the development node command to the transaction coordinator, negotiated relay actions and bounded pool-backed block template assembly. Serving and mining use the synchronized pool view; the development command remains a private testnet interface rather than a production node compatibility claim.

